Package: thiessen
Title: Bayesian Additive Voronoi Tessellations
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Leo", "Thomson", , "leo@feasibly.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("The authors of the vendored Rust crates", role = "cph",
           comment = "listed in inst/AUTHORS"))
Description: Bindings to the 'thiessen' Rust crate, an implementation of
    AddiVortes, Bayesian regression on a sum of Voronoi tessellations
    (Stone and Gosling, 2025, <doi:10.1080/10618600.2024.2414104>). This
    version builds and links the core crate from vendored sources; the
    modelling interface follows.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/l-thomson/thiessen
BugReports: https://github.com/l-thomson/thiessen/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/thiessen/core-version: 0.2.0
SystemRequirements: Cargo (Rust's package manager), rustc >= 1.74
